{
  "description": "AttomusOTP GA Migration Parser — test vectors",
  "format_version": 1,
  "notes": [
    "Real otpauth-migration:// payloads encoded with the documented GA protobuf schema.",
    "GA algorithm field: 1=SHA1 2=SHA256 3=SHA512",
    "GA digits field: 1=six 2=eight",
    "GA type field: 1=HOTP 2=TOTP",
    "TOTP period not encoded in GA format — default to 30.",
    "When issuer field absent/empty, parse from label 'Issuer:account' if colon present.",
    "secret_hex is raw seed bytes as passed to TOTP.generate / HOTP.generate."
  ],
  "vectors": [
    {
